cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this platform in research or writing, cite it as below."
title: "Tianji (DU) — Local-Only Chinese Metaphysics Master Arena"
abstract: >-
  A static, backend-free evaluation platform for Chinese metaphysics readings.
  Two verified fact kernels (Zi Ping four pillars and Mei Hua Yi Shu) answer the
  same question under blind conditions; users score before the methods are
  revealed, and dated falsifiable claims are tracked in a local ledger. All
  computation and storage happen in the browser — no question, birth data,
  chart, reading, vote or claim is transmitted.
version: 0.5.2
date-released: 2026-11-04
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
